      "children": [
       {
        "id": "ot-h-2mcar",
        "type": "html",
        "settings": {
         "html_content": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:32px;align-items:stretch\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;background:var(--olo-color-background);border:1px solid var(--olo-color-border);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04)\"><div style=\"height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--olo-color-muted);color:var(--olo-color-text-faint);font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:0 24px\">Foto: docente in aula durante un’attività</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;flex:1 1 auto;padding:32px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--olo-font-family-heading,'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--olo-color-primary)\">01</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;color:var(--olo-color-text-muted)\">In classe</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--olo-font-family-heading,'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,32px);line-height:1.15;color:var(--olo-color-text)\">L’ora di lezione</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--olo-color-muted-contrast)\">Decine di attività da comporre sui propri contenuti, dentro e fuori dall’aula. In qualunque materia, per il tempo che decide chi insegna.</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px\"><a href=\"/l-ora-di-lezione/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;background:var(--olo-color-primary);color:var(--olo-color-primary-contrast);border:1px solid var(--olo-color-primary)\">Vedi le attività <span style=\"font-size:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;background:var(--olo-color-secondary);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(15,23,42,.14)\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;padding:32px 32px 28px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--olo-font-family-heading,'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 70%, var(--olo-color-background))\">02</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 62%, transparent)\">A casa</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--olo-font-family-heading,'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,32px);line-height:1.15;color:var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast)\">I giorni fra le lezioni</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 76%, transparent)\">Ogni errore diventa una carta di ripasso con una data di ritorno. Cinque nuove al giorno, uguali per tutti: nessun impegno in più, per nessuno.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:0 32px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:14px 16px;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 6%, transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 12%, transparent);border-radius:10px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast)\">Storia</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 62%, transparent)\">4 carte · Il Congresso di Vienna</span></div><span style=\"flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9999px;white-space:nowrap;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 16%, transparent);color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 55%, var(--olo-color-background))\">oggi</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:14px 16px;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 6%, transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 12%, transparent);border-radius:10px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast)\">Fisica</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 62%, transparent)\">2 carte · Moto uniformemente accelerato</span></div><span style=\"flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9999px;white-space:nowrap;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 16%, transparent);color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 55%, var(--olo-color-background))\">fra 2 giorni</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:14px 16px;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 6%, transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 12%, transparent);border-radius:10px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast)\">Diritto</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 62%, transparent)\">3 carte · Fonti del diritto</span></div><span style=\"flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9999px;white-space:nowrap;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 16%, transparent);color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-primary) 55%, var(--olo-color-background))\">fra 9 giorni</span></div><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 62%, transparent)\">La coda di ripasso di oggi</p></div><div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding:28px 32px 32px\"><a href=\"/i-giorni-fra-le-lezioni/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;background:transparent;color:var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--olo-color-secondary-contrast) 26%, transparent)\">Come funziona lo studio <span style=\"font-size:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div>",
